mosquitto
------------------------------------------
Eclipse Mosquitto is an open source (EPL/EDL licensed) message broker that
implements the MQTT protocol versions 5.0, 3.1.1 and 3.1. Mosquitto is
lightweight and is suitable for use on all devices from low power single board
computers to full servers.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcares2-1.34.9-1
  libcjson1-1.7.19-1bl2
  libedit0-20251016-1
  libmosquitto-devel-2.1.2-1bl1
  libmosquitto1-2.1.2-1bl1
  libmosquittopp-devel-2.1.2-1bl1
  libmosquittopp1-2.1.2-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libwrap0-7.6-26
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  CUnit-2.1.3-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcares-devel-1.34.9-1
  libcjson-devel-1.7.19-1bl2
  libedit-devel-20251016-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libwrap-devel-7.6-26
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/eclipse-mosquitto/mosquitto/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/eclipse-mosquitto/mosquitto/archive/refs/tags/v2.1.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mosquitto-2.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mosquitto-2.1.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mosquitto-2.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mosquitto-2.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmosquitto1-2.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmosquitto-devel-2.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmosquittopp1-2.1.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmosquittopp-devel-2.1.2-X.tar.xz

